|edamame]] ([[Cookbook:Soybean|soy beans]])\n*1 large [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrot]], shredded\n*½ cup salted [[Cookbook:Roasting|roasted]] [[Cookbook:Peanut|peanuts]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n#[[Cookbook:Whisk|Whisk]] sauce ingredients together in small bowl.\n#In a pan, heat 1 tbsp oil. [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] eggs, then chop them up and remove from the pan.\n#In the same pan, heat 2 tbsp oil. Fry the frozen edamame beans for 2–3 minutes until cooked.\n#Add the rice and sauce and [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|toss]]. Then, add in the shredded carrot, peanuts, and the eggs and fry for 2–3 more minutes.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes for fried rice]]\n[[Category:Thai recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peanut]]\n[[Category:Recipes using nuts and seeds]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using corn syrup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using golden syrup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Thai Peanut Fried Rice","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 tbsp soy sauce","sourceText":"1 tbsp soy sauce","amountText":"1 tbsp soy sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tbsp water","sourceText":"1 tbsp water","amountText":"1 tbsp water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 tsp golden syrup or corn syrup","sourceText":"2 tsp golden syrup or corn syrup","amountText":"2 tsp golden syrup or corn syrup","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 tsp peanut butter","sourceText":"2 tsp peanut butter","amountText":"2 tsp peanut butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tbsp Thai red curry paste","sourceText":"1 tbsp Thai red curry paste","amountText":"1 tbsp Thai red curry paste","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 tbsp C